18. BUILD IN MILESTONES
==================================================

Do not attempt to implement everything in one uncontrolled generation.

MILESTONE 1 — FOUNDATION
Build the design system, responsive landing page, navigation, authentication entry points, component library and application shell.

MILESTONE 2 — IDENTITY AND DATA
Implement real authentication, user roles, talent profiles, business profiles, persistent storage and access controls.

MILESTONE 3 — MARKETPLACE
Implement categories, project creation, discovery, filtering, applications and shortlisting.

MILESTONE 4 — ENGAGEMENTS
Implement selected candidates, agreed project terms, deliverables, revisions, completion and eligible reviews.

MILESTONE 5 — ADMINISTRATION
Implement verification workflows, moderation, reporting, audit records and basic analytics.

MILESTONE 6 — PILOT READINESS
Test the full workflow, correct defects, inspect security, verify mobile usability, and prepare a controlled pilot.

After each milestone, report:
- What actually works.
- What remains incomplete.
- What backend integrations are configured.
- What tests were performed.
- What limitations remain.
- The next recommended step.

Preserve working features during subsequent iterations.

